            "detailed_description": "Roll the dice in a mystical world filled with exploration, puzzle-solving, and adventure!  Mixing action based and puzzle mechanics in a 3D world, Voodoo Dice is an innovative, challenging puzzler that plays with your mind to lead you to solve puzzles in unique and interesting ways.<br>\t\t\t\t\tEncounter a funny and original universe, with great style and vibe, travel between different maps, defeat your enemies and solve enigmas.<br>\t\t\t\t\tBe prepared to work your roll technique - Voodoo Dice will win you over with its addictive gameplay and countless hours of Voodoo fun!<br>\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2>\t\t\t\t\t<strong>60 Levels of Play</strong>:<br>\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"bb_ul\">\t\t\t\t\t<li>Travel through 60 levels and hundreds of possible paths to victory<br>\t\t\t\t\t</li></ul>\t\t\t\t\t<strong>A Living World</strong>: <br>\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"bb_ul\">\t\t\t\t\t<li>Defeat enemies and solve enigmas in a funny and original universe with great style and vibe. There are four fascinating, 3-D worlds to explore including Jungle, Castle, Savannah, and Tropical. <br>\t\t\t\t\t</li></ul>\t\t\t\t\t<strong>Endless Variety of Gameplay</strong>: <br>\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"bb_ul\">\t\t\t\t\t<li>Play with dice attributes to solve numerous enigmas<br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Unlock 8 new skins as you make your way through countless challenges and reach the top online ranking<br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Interact with different parts of the environment to open your path to victory<br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Hundreds of possible path each time for only few solutions.<br>\t\t\t\t\t</li></ul>\t\t\t\t\t<strong>Refreshing graphics</strong>:<br>\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"bb_ul\">\t\t\t\t\t<li>Four different worlds and atmospheres to explore and to complete, from Jungle to Castle passing by Savannah and Tropical<br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>HD support with entire 3D rendering.<br>\t\t\t\t\t</li></ul>",
